  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Personally I always show all avatars regardless of their rating as long as they are below 50MB, I would like to have the ability to finetune that more, like being able to set a custom max cap for polygons, texture memory etc. before the persons avatar turns into a fallback.\n\nRight now, a Very Poor avatar can be anything from 70,001 polygons to MILLIONS of polygons. Only being able to set a custom max avatar download size is not enough. I want to allow myself for a bit more freedom in the avatars I show by default without being forced to show actual nukes.",
